      "text": "**Docker Image Slimming (Pinned / Paused): (Alexander Somma)**\n- [x] Hit the ~2.5GB target (down from 9.7GB)\n- [ ] Hit the ~1.5GB base-image target after trimming heavy transitive deps\n\n`TODO.md:L339`",
